msgid "don't attempt to renew the certificate when expiration nears"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງພະຍາຍາມຕໍ່ອາຍຸໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເມື່ອໃກ້ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ"

#: src/getcert.c:789 src/getcert.c:1866
